<li>A written, TDI-compliant agreement if you choose to hire us, with a 72-hour right to rescind.</li>
<li>Inspection, photo documentation, and storm-date research.</li>
<li>Separate, well-organized estimates for each coverage that applies.</li>
<li>Ongoing communication with each insurer until the claims are resolved.</li>
</ol>

